# @hub-lanes

# ── SPLIT-FAMILY WATCHDOG (BH-1793) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 min: walk the split families of the projects in
# SPLIT_WATCHDOG_PROJECTS (empty by default, so it walks nothing) and take at
# most one step per family through sw_next_step/sw_act. One summary line per
# tick in logs/split-watchdog.log. flock -n dedupes; a held lock skips the tick.
# Off: flags/lane-off-split-watchdog, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off split-watchdog.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/split-watchdog.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
